#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 返回按鈕
msgid "Back"
msgstr "返回"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 方向燈自動變換車道功能標題
msgid "Auto Lane Change by Blinker"
msgstr "方向燈自動變換車道"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 方向燈自動變換車道功能詳細描述
msgid ""
"Set a timer to delay the auto lane change operation when the blinker is used. "
"No nudge on the steering wheel is required to auto lane change if a timer is set. Default is Nudge.<br>"
"Please use caution when using this feature. Only use the blinker when traffic and road conditions permit."
msgstr ""
"設定使用方向燈時，延遲自動變換車道操作的計時器。"
"若設定了計時器，變換車道時便無需輕推方向盤。預設為需要輕推（Nudge）。<br>"
"使用此功能請務必小心。僅在交通與路況允許時才使用方向燈。"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 計時器選項 - 關閉
msgid "Off"
msgstr "關閉"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 計時器選項 - 需要輕推方向盤
msgid "Nudge"
msgstr "輕推方向盤"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 計時器選項 - 無須輕推方向盤
msgid "Nudgeless"
msgstr "無須輕推"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 秒數單位
msgid "s"
msgstr "秒"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 盲點延遲功能標題
msgid "Auto Lane Change: Delay with Blind Spot"
msgstr "自動變換車道：盲點延遲"

#: openpilot/system/ui/sunnypilot/lane_change_settings.py
# 說明: 盲點延遲功能詳細描述
msgid ""
"Toggle to enable a delay timer for seamless lane changes when blind spot monitoring "
"(BSM) detects a obstructing vehicle, ensuring safe maneuvering."
msgstr ""
"啟用延遲計時器，當盲點偵測 (BSM) 偵測到障礙車輛時暫緩變換車道，確保行車安全。"


